JDepend Maven Plugin
====================

This plugin produces a nicely formatted metrics report based on your project.

This plugin uses the [JDepend library in version ${jdependVersion}](http://clarkware.com/software/JDepend.html)
to fulfill it's purposes.

Goals Overview
--------------

- [jdepend:generate](./generate-mojo.html) Run JDepend and generate a site report.
- [jdepend:generate-no-fork](./generate-no-fork-mojo.html) Run JDepend and generate a site report (without forking the life cycle).

Usage
-----

Instructions on how to use the JDepend Maven Plugin can be found on the [usage page](./usage.html).

Examples
--------

To provide you with better understanding of some usages of the JDepend
Maven Plugin, you can take a look into the following example:

